message: "Si utiliza FabroGym o su paquete de replicación, cite esta versión del proyecto."
type: software
title: "FabroGym: explainability requirements and reproducible requirements-engineering artifacts"
version: "2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-01"
abstract: "FabroGym is an ISR-401 requirements-engineering project for a local gym, including a terminal SRS, traceability, an MVP, and a reproducible field-study package on explainability requirements for a proposed fitness-routine recommendation component."
